{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-54",
  "title": "Subdomains & Tenants",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Subdomains & Tenants"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Setting Up Dynamic Subdomains for a Nuxt 3 App on Vercel with Namecheap"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Setting up dynamic subdomains for a Nuxt 3 application hosted on Vercel, with a domain purchased through Namecheap, can seem complex. However, by breaking down the process step by step, it becomes manageable and straightforward. This guide will walk you through the entire process of configuring your setup so that public streams are accessible at `docket.tv/${broadcaster_id}` and the admin CMS for broadcasters is available at `${broadcaster_name}.docket.tv`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Overview of the Process"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here’s a high-level overview of what we’ll be doing:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Set Up Your Domain in Namecheap:** Configure your domain to point to Vercel’s servers, allowing Vercel to manage your DNS settings, including wildcard subdomains."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Configure Vercel for Dynamic Subdomains:** Ensure that Vercel is set up to handle wildcard subdomains, directing traffic to the appropriate sections of your Nuxt 3 application."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Configure Nuxt 3 for Dynamic Routing:** Set up your Nuxt 3 application to handle the routing logic based on the subdomain being accessed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 1: Set Up Your Domain in Namecheap"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Objective:** Configure Namecheap to direct your domain (e.g., `docket.tv`) to Vercel, and allow Vercel to manage DNS records, including wildcard subdomains."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Actionable Tasks:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Log in to Namecheap:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Go to [Namecheap](https://www.namecheap.com/) and log into your account."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Navigate to the Domain List:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Once logged in, click on the \"Domain List\" tab on the left sidebar to view your purchased domains."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Select Your Domain ([docket.tv](http://docket.tv/)):**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Find `docket.tv` in your list of domains and click the \"Manage\" button next to it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Update the DNS Settings:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Scroll down to the \"Nameservers\" section."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Select \"Custom DNS\" from the dropdown menu."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Enter Vercel’s nameservers:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `ns1.vercel-dns.com`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `ns2.vercel-dns.com`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Save your changes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Set Up Wildcard Subdomain:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- In the same DNS management page, scroll down to the \"Advanced DNS\" tab."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Add a new CNAME record:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Type:** CNAME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Host:** ``"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Value:** `cname.vercel-dns.com`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **TTL:** Automatic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- This wildcard subdomain setup will allow any subdomain (like `${broadcaster_name}.docket.tv`) to be handled by Vercel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Check-in:** Ensure that these steps are completed and valid before moving to the next step. If you encounter any issues, recheck the settings or consult Namecheap’s support."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 2: Configure Vercel for Dynamic Subdomains"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Objective:** Set up Vercel to manage dynamic subdomains, allowing traffic to be routed correctly based on the subdomain used."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Actionable Tasks:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Check for Wildcard Support:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Since you’ve added `.docket.tv` as a wildcard domain in Vercel, Vercel can now handle any subdomain directed to it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Set Up Environment Variables (if needed):**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If your Nuxt 3 app needs to be aware of which subdomain is being accessed, you might need to pass this information as an environment variable in Vercel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Test the Wildcard Subdomain:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Deploy your application to Vercel and test if different subdomains route correctly to your app."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Visit `broadcaster.docket.tv` and ensure that it reaches the intended part of your application."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Check-in:** Ensure the wildcard domain works correctly with your Vercel configuration. Make sure any specific subdomains (e.g., `api.docket.tv`) are still functioning as expected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 3: Configure Your Nuxt 3 App for Dynamic Subdomains"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Objective:** Configure your Nuxt 3 application to recognize and appropriately handle requests based on the subdomain accessed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Actionable Tasks:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Create Middleware to Handle Subdomains:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Create a middleware file, for example, `middleware/subdomain.js` in your Nuxt 3 project."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- This file should extract the subdomain from the request’s host header and perform necessary actions (e.g., loading specific data based on the subdomain)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here’s an example in JavaScript:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```jsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export default defineNuxtRouteMiddleware((to, from) => {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const host = process.server"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "? useRequestHeaders().host"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ": window.location.host;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const parts = host.split('.');"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const subdomain = parts.length > 2 ? parts[0] : null;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if (subdomain) {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "console.log(`Subdomain: ${subdomain}`);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Load specific data or redirect based on subdomain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "});"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Adjust for Local Testing:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Modify your middleware to account for testing on localhost by checking if the host includes `localhost` and adjusting the subdomain logic accordingly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Integrate Middleware:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- In your `nuxt.config.js`, ensure this middleware runs globally by adding it to the router middleware section."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Test the Configuration:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Run your Nuxt app locally or deploy to Vercel and test with various subdomains to ensure routing works as expected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Check-in:** Ensure your middleware correctly handles subdomains and routes to the appropriate content. If issues arise, revisit the logic or consult the Nuxt 3 documentation."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}